test('Draw Shape creates every primitive including grid and open spiral',()=>{for(const kind of ['rectangle','ellipse','triangle','star','arrow','spiral','grid']){const g=A.vectorPrimitive(kind,0,0,100,80,3,2);assert.ok(g.length&&g.every(p=>p.points.length>=2));if(kind==='grid')assert.equal(g.length,7);if(kind==='spiral')assert.equal(g[0].closed,false);}});
