test('Magnet and all deformation tools write selected point keys',()=>{for(const tool of ['magnet','noise','shear','perspective','bend']){reset();const L=layer(),p=path(L,[[-20,-20],[20,20],[50,-10]]);A.S.mode='animate';A.S.frame=10;A.S.selPts=new Set(p.pts.slice(0,2));down(tool,400,300);move(tool,430,340);up(tool);assert.equal(Object.keys(L.ch).length,2);assert.ok(p.pts.slice(0,2).every(id=>L.ch['pt:'+id]));assert.equal(L.ch['pt:'+p.pts[2]],undefined);}});
